Map data

data.js is a database derived from OpenStreetMap.
© OpenStreetMap contributors. It is made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
See https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Screenshots in docs/ are produced works made from OpenStreetMap data
(© OpenStreetMap contributors).

Building floor counts from the Korean building register (V-World,
LT_C_BLDGINFO) are fetched at runtime with each user's own API key and shown
on screen only. They are not stored in or distributed with this repository.
